give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Poppyganda\"", "italic": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Chef", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing how many pairs of evil players there are."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Librarian", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Outsider. (Or that zero are in play.)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bounty Hunter", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 1 evil player. If the player you know dies, you learn another evil player tonight. [1 Townsfolk is evil]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Pixie", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 1 in-play Townsfolk. If you were mad that you were this character, you gain their ability when they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fortune Teller", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose 2 players: you learn if either is a Demon. There is a good player that registers as a Demon to you."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Town Crier", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, you learn if a Minion nominated today."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Oracle", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, you learn how many dead players are evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Monk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player (not yourself): they are safe from the Demon tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Savant", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach day, you may visit the Storyteller to learn 2 things in private: 1 is true & 1 is false."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Juggler", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOn your 1st day, publicly guess up to 5 players' characters. That night, you learn how many you got correct."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Farmer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you die at night, an alive good player becomes a Farmer."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mayor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf only 3 players live & no execution occurs, your team wins. If you die at night, another player might die instead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Poppy Grower", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nMinions & Demons do not know each other. If you die, they learn who each other are that night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lunatic", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou think you are a Demon, but you are not. The Demon knows who you are & who you choose at night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Drunk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know you are the Drunk. You think you are a Townsfolk character, but you are not."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mutant", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you are \"mad\" about being an Outsider, you might be executed."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Snitch", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach Minion gets 3 bluffs."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cerenovus", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player & a good character: they are \"mad\" they are this character tomorrow, or might be executed."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Marionette", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou think you are a good character, but you are not. The Demon knows who you are. [You neighbor the Demon]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Evil Twin", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou & an opposing player know each other. If the good player is executed, evil wins. Good can't win if you both live."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Baron", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nThere are extra Outsiders in play. [+2 Outsiders]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Imp", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. If you kill yourself this way, a Minion becomes the Imp."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Vortox", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. Townsfolk abilities yield false info. Each day, if no-one is executed, evil wins."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Legion", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, a player might die. Executions fail if only evil voted. You register as a Minion too. [Most players are Legion]"]],title:"Script Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Poppyganda Script", "italic": false, "color": "gold", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Poppyganda\"", "italic": false, "color": "gold"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]